{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2019-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1555977600, "end_date": 1556668799, "month_true_total": 304, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:09:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50409903", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118345536", "personaname": "COVID-19", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/__COVID-19__/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 45173, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 40836, "last_played": 1604687251, "avatar": "61fd11fb8c806cbc96d08aa40eccc989c1c24cda"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awwwwwwwwwwwesome", "timestamp_created": 1556657515, "timestamp_updated": 1556657515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50409831", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996575305", "personaname": "Narsiph", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Narsiph/", "num_games_owned": 698, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 149760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 130114, "last_played": 1748428573, "avatar": "fc5d8974fd3b0cd4519d382edd70e89172d6da5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dont buy something you dont want to support. Dont open your mouth and quawk - Instead, do something. I wont buy Third Party DLCs for the full price. Instead i will buy them only when they're 75% off - at minimum.\n\nBeside of that, ArmA 3 hast a lot to offer. Still a modern military simulation game with something for everyone. Roleplayers, MilSim Players, Action-Players - Everyone will find something in ArmA 3.\n\nWould i recommend this game to anyone? No. Would i recommend it to anyone that kind of like military-stuff and or a huge modability? Yes.", "timestamp_created": 1556657193, "timestamp_updated": 1556657193, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50409705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198825207174", "personaname": "cannon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198825207174/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 145924, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 421, "playtime_at_review": 48556, "last_played": 1791133617, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arma 3 is a very diverse game that has its ups and downs. Im gonna be honest and if you play unmodded after about 100 hours you'll never want to touch it again. But modded it is the ultimate game. You can do ANYTHING you wnat to. Vietnam war? Done! WW2? Done! Star Wars? Done! Napoleonic wars? Done! Anime weeb camouflage hoover tanks? Probably Ive never looked", "timestamp_created": 1556656662, "timestamp_updated": 1556656662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50409224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087782839", "personaname": "Kyo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Someone_you_dont_know/", "num_games_owned": 664, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 148038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 82293, "last_played": 1771732935, "avatar": "1c9da5b4054e72dc2900853fd853ccc5be138e92"}, "language": "english", "review": "I found this game very fun, I forgot to review this game for a long time. While the controls may be extremely complex at times, it can also be very fun with friends. I found the best times I've had on this game, has been with Units, a group of players that are either pvp or pve and sometimes heavily simulate military life, some are more chill. I personally love this game, and I recommend it greatly, I've made alot of friends, and met players who are extremely skilled at the game. If you like realistic military shooters, then this would be a great addition to your library. The mods for this game also expand its life, there are mods like ACE, that makes combat a bit more realistic, and many others! I love this game and its always gonna be in my top 5.", "timestamp_created": 1556655060, "timestamp_updated": 1556655060, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50404407", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062445001", "personaname": "Scrumumlux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/calzilla1/", "num_games_owned": 842, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 2925, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2791, "last_played": 1685504837, "avatar": "3e7fa82d331c950cc2dffca68c4e0f723849cff0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Paid mods part 2", "timestamp_created": 1556638204, "timestamp_updated": 1556638204, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.452089309692382812", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}